    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Final Result 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T15:10:17+05:30\"\u003eJune 4, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e3:10 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in/\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Phase-II Final Result\u003c/strong\u003e on the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the \u003cstrong\u003eDriver, Office Attendant\u0026nbsp;Examination 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003ePhase-II\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eExam\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003ewas conducted on\u003cstrong\u003e 25 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;application process started on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\"\u003e29 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\"\u003e20 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ePhase-II Final Result \u003c/strong\u003eusing their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Advt.No. 01/2025)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Revised Final Result 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-vidhan-parishad-driver-office-attendant-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e29 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e20 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cstrong\u003e22 October\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date :\u003cstrong\u003e 21 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e17 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003cstrong\u003e03 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003e28 April 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePhase-II Exam Date : 25 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePhase-II Admit Card : \u003cstrong\u003e21 May 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePhase-II Result (Driver) : \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e04 June 2026\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003eAvailable Now\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDV Date (Driver) : \u003cstrong\u003e09 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cb\u003eBihar Vidhan Sabha \u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAll Candidates :\u003cstrong\u003e Rs. 100/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2025.\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Year\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e37 Years (UR Male)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e40 Years (UR Female)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e40 Years (BC/ EBC Male, Female)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e42 Years (SC/ ST Male, Female)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad \u003c/b\u003eprovides age relaxation for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDriver, Office Attendant\u0026nbsp;position\u003c/strong\u003e as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e24 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDriver\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e09 Post\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have passed \u003cstrong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"173\"\u003e10th Class\u003c/strong\u003e from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of \u003cstrong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"260\"\u003eHindi and English languages\u003c/strong\u003e, possess a valid \u003cstrong data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"305\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eLMV/HMV Driving License\u003c/strong\u003e, and also have the \u003cstrong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"354\"\u003eability to ride a bicycle\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 18.8521%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOffice Attendant\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 14.1771%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e15 Post\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.9707%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have passed \u003cstrong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"146\"\u003e10th Class\u003c/strong\u003e from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of \u003cstrong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"233\"\u003eHindi and English languages\u003c/strong\u003e and must have the \u003cstrong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"281\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eability to ride a bicycle\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check : \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/dsssb-non-teaching-various-post-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eDSSSB Non-Teaching Various Post Online Form 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Result 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• Visit the official \u003cstrong\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad website.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"54\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• On the homepage, click on the \u003cstrong\u003e“Driver Phase-II Result 2026” link.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"128\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• Enter your \u003cstrong\u003eRegistration Number, Password/Date of Birth,\u003c/strong\u003e and required details.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"210\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• Fill in the \u003cstrong\u003eCaptcha Code and click on the Login button.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"270\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• Your Phase-II \u003cstrong\u003eResult will appear\u003c/strong\u003e on the screen.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"405\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e• Download the \u003cstrong\u003eResult PDF\u003c/strong\u003e for future use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 144px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 27px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : \u003c/span\u003eMode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWritten Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriving Test (For Driver Only)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDocument Verification\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedical Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003c