ms-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e When will the \u003cstrong\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Result 2026\u003c/strong\u003e be released?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e The result has released\u003cstrong\u003e online after the Phase-II examination.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e How can I download the \u003cstrong\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Result 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates can download the result by visiting the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website and logging in with their credentials.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e What details are required to\u003cstrong\u003e download the result?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e You may need your \u003cstrong\u003eRegistration Number, Password/Date of Birth, and Captcha Code.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e Is it mandatory to carry the \u003cstrong\u003eadmit card to the exam center?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer: Yes, candidates must carry a printed copy of the admit card to the examination center.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website for \u003cb\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad\u003c/b\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website for \u003cb\u003eBihar Vidhan Parishad \u003c/b\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in/.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36138 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-20-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Final Result 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-20-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-20-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-20-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-20.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"gb-headline-text\"\u003eSarkari Result.Com.Cm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctable style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"width:50%; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLatest Posts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-mts-havaldar-2026/\"\u003eSSC MTS / Havaldar Result 2026 – Soon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/india-post-gds-2026/\"\u003eIndia Pos